# SYSTEM > KNOBS: CONTROLLER. On HOME the seven knobs are a MIDI controller: K1-K4 CC 74-77, SELECT 78,
# ALGO 79, PRESETS 80, each its value 0..127 (two a click), on the MIDI channel; Penumbra's sound, scene and
# page stay as they are. The holds, and every other page, are Penumbra's. The values are kept.
autoplay 0
wait 300
tap GLO
turn SELECT 5
tap SEL
expect knobs 1
tap HOME
expect view 0
turn K1 3
expect ctl0 6
expect cc_out74 6
expect shape11 75
turn K4 10
expect cc_out77 20
turn SELECT 4
expect cc_out78 8
expect scene 1
turn ALGO 5
expect cc_out79 10
expect hpage 0
expect set_bpm 90
turn PRESET 2
expect cc_out80 4
wait 200
expect travelling 0
expect scene 1
shot controller.png
# a hold is Penumbra's: a drone key held, K2 its TONE
key b0 down
turn K2 2
key b0 up
expect ctl1 0
# another page: Penumbra's (FX's REVERB DECAY)
tap FX
turn K1 2
expect ctl0 6
expect fx0 95
tap HOME
tap SAVE
reboot
wait 300
expect knobs 1
expect ctl3 20
expect ctl6 4
